["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Rannan Korren says: The black dragonflight asked us to help with retrieving some artifacts. Get your gear on and scale that cliff!",
["timestamp"] = 1787662619,
["id"] = "s58_3370",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: Shore up our flanks! I don't want any surprises from the Sundered Flame.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662635,
["id"] = "s58_3371",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wrathion",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Wrathion says: Sabellian, something dark saps my strength within these halls. Can you feel it?",
["timestamp"] = 1787662640,
["id"] = "s58_3372",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: I do. It is nearly overwhelming. Thankfully, our champions seem unaffected.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662645,
["id"] = "s58_3373",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: All the more reason to stop Sarkareth now. He must not be allowed to claim whatever power still lurks here.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662653,
["id"] = "s58_3374",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sabellian",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sabellian says: We have you pinned, Sarkareth! End this madness before more of your soldiers die.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662660,
["id"] = "s58_3375",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: We would rather die than return to subjugation.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662666,
["id"] = "s58_3376",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: The secrets within this crucible are ours to claim! With their power, we will never serve again!",
["timestamp"] = 1787662670,
["id"] = "s58_3377",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
