["text"] = "Zskarn says: During my time serving Neltharion, I assisted him in creating many... powerful elements.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662688,
["id"] = "s58_3380",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zskarn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zskarn says: One of these instruments could be of great service to you... though it may not distinguish between friend and foe.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662695,
["id"] = "s58_3381",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: What is this power?",
["timestamp"] = 1787662705,
["id"] = "s58_3382",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zskarn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zskarn says: In the quest to perfect Neltharion's armor, we went through many iterations.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662706,
["id"] = "s58_3383",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zskarn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zskarn says: This is one of our more successful attempts. While imperfect, it will be more than enough to destroy these interlopers.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662711,
["id"] = "s58_3384",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: Do it!",
["timestamp"] = 1787662720,
["id"] = "s58_3385",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Winglord Dezran",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Winglord Dezran says: But our troops are still out there!",
["timestamp"] = 1787662721,
["id"] = "s58_3386",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scalecommander Sarkareth says: Their names will ever be remembered.",
["timestamp"] = 1787662723,
["id"] = "s58_3387",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
