["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ethereal Warpweaver says: Your attire seems adequate. How may I assist you?",
["timestamp"] = 1787676506,
["id"] = "s58_4221",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: We must be careful. Untold horrors could be waking in the temple.",
["timestamp"] = 1787676696,
["id"] = "s58_4222",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: For thousands of years, dis temple been sealed away. We did not know why.",
["timestamp"] = 1787676701,
["id"] = "s58_4223",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Now we know it was to hide de Soulcoiler's unspeakable rituals--and de body of Ula'tek.",
["timestamp"] = 1787676708,
["id"] = "s58_4224",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: And my brother has dug it all up again! Dey were all buried for a reason, Zul'jan! What have you got yourself into?",
["timestamp"] = 1787676715,
["id"] = "s58_4225",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "HUNTER",
["race"] = "NightElf",
["name"] = "Elrythe-Terenas",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = -0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = -0,
},
["text"] = "Elrythe-Terenas receives loot: |cnIQ1:|T7549246:12|t|Hitem:238513::::::::90:267::::1:38:13:::::|h[Void-Tempered Scales |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx3.",
["timestamp"] = 1787676726,
["id"] = "s58_4226",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: We've awakened de spirits!",
["timestamp"] = 1787676728,
["id"] = "s58_4227",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: There is a dark presence. One I know well. Nek'zali--the one who raised Ula'tek--is here!",
["timestamp"] = 1787676731,
["id"] = "s58_4228",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Nek'zali the Soulcoiler",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Nek'zali the Soulcoiler yells: Heh heh. So... you have come again?",
["timestamp"] = 1787676747,
["id"] = "s58_4229",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Nek'zali the Soulcoiler",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Nek'zali the Soulcoiler yells: Flesh, breath, and bone. You think yourselves masters of what sleeps below.",
["timestamp"] = 1787676753,
["id"] = "s58_4230",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Nek'zali the Soulcoiler",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Nek'zali the Soulcoiler yells: Dey thought their bones could hold me. But bones... crumble. Coils... only loosen with time.",
["timestamp"] = 1787676762,
["id"] = "s58_4231",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Hellavator-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Nek'zali the Soulcoiler",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Nek'zali the Soulcoiler yells: Mmm... de coils still hum with power. Even stone got a memory.",
["timestamp"] = 1787676773,
["id"] = "s58_4232",
},
