found our... your target, Riftblade. Why do you insist on waiting?\",\"id\":\"s50_4079\",\"timestamp\":1781650575},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: We are not charging in through another portal blind, Decimus. We need a few experts before we mobilize, starting with our champion here.\",\"id\":\"s50_4080\",\"timestamp\":1781650585},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: I appreciate your discretion in this matter, hero. Come, let us speak privately.\",\"id\":\"s50_4081\",\"timestamp\":1781650596},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: The Grand Magister awaits us in the Terrace. Hopefully our welcome is warmer than our last visit.\",\"id\":\"s50_4082\",\"timestamp\":1781650600},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Behold, the Sunstrider Omnium...\",\"id\":\"s50_4083\",\"timestamp\":1781650645},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Silent and dormant since the fall of King Anasterian. Until now...\",\"id\":\"s50_4084\",\"timestamp\":1781650648},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Omnial Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Omnial Echo says: Omnial d-d-damage detected. M-m-mirror Echo Imprint--Failure imminent.\",\"id\":\"s50_4085\",\"timestamp\":1781650663},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Dar'Khan Drathir\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Dar'Khan Drathir says: I will not be denied the knowledge within any longer--the Void Magicule is mine!\",\"id\":\"s50_4086\",\"timestamp\":1781650668},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Tizziot-Proudmoore\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tizziot-Proudmoore|h[|cffff7c0aTizziot-Proudmoore|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:515:Player-5-0EAA0FA8:1:6:16:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[500 Honorable Kills]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s50_4087\",\"timestamp\":1781650683},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Tizziot-Proudmoore\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_YELL\",\"type\":\"YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tizziot-Proudmoore:40:YELL:|h[|cffff7c0aTizziot-Proudmoore|r]|h yells: [Orcish] =NogU=\",\"id\":\"s50_4088\",\"timestamp\":1781650718},{\"recordedBy\":\"Manyfaced-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Omnial Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Omnial Echo says: Sunstrider Key-Cipher not recognized. Mirror Echo 