ONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Guard says: Silvermoon was saved despite the recklessness of another human wielding the Light.\",\"timestamp\":1784559996,\"id\":\"s51_2577\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos receives loot: |cnIQ0:|T458717:12|t|Hitem:176869::::::::80:66:::::::::|h[Bone Chip]|h|rx2.\",\"timestamp\":1784560152,\"id\":\"s51_2578\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos receives loot: |cnIQ0:|T442733:12|t|Hitem:176874::::::::80:66:::::::::|h[Desiccated Humerus]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1784560152,\"id\":\"s51_2579\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos receives loot: |cnIQ2:|T3528460:12|t|Hitem:173204::::::::80:66:::::::::|h[Lightless Silk]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1784560152,\"id\":\"s51_2580\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos receives loot: |cnIQ1:|T3528456:12|t|Hitem:173202::::::::80:66:::::::::|h[Shrouded Cloth]|h|rx3.\",\"timestamp\":1784560152,\"id\":\"s51_2581\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mueh'zala\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Mueh'zala yells: Where ya be hidin' all dem Zandalari souls, Bwonsamdi? Give 'em ta ya bossmon now, or ya gonna be sorry. Reeeeaaal sorry!\",\"timestamp\":1784560155,\"id\":\"s51_2582\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi yells: So ya can be sendin' dem to da Maw? No, no, no... dem is my people, Mueh'zala. No way I gonna give dem up!\",\"timestamp\":1784560166,\"id\":\"s51_2583\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: Now here's a loa ya might remember! Hakkar always be needin' mojo for his rituals... and Bwonsamdi always be willin' ta make a deal.\",\"timestamp\":1784560170,\"id\":\"s51_2584\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mueh'zala\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Mueh'zala yells: Ya always be soft, Bwonsamdi. Weak. Sooner or later, ya gonna break. Den da Jailer be getting' his due!\",\"timestamp\":1784560177,\"id\":\"s51_2585\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: Well whatcha givin' me dat look for? Sure, Hakkar be a loa of blood. But a deal's a deal, mon! Just get me mojo back.\",\"timestamp\":1784560182,\"id\":\"s51_2586\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: Wait... who...? Heroes! Uh... no hard feelins 'bout dat little disagreement dat we had in Zuldazar?\",\"timestamp\":1784560194,\"id\":\"s51_2587\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: Mueh'zala got me at a... disadvantage. But if ya collect me mojo from a few of me... business partners... den together, we can turn da tables on him!\",\"timestamp\":1784560206,\"id\":\"s51_2588\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Atal'ai High Priest\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Atal'ai High Priest attempts to run away in fear!\",\"timestamp\":1784560213,\"id\":\"s51_2589\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: I be keepin' dis ol' loa distracted. Go on, now. Follow da paths. And don't ya be takin' no for an answer!\",\"timestamp\":1784560218,\"id\":\"s51_2590\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Atal'ai High Priest\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Atal'ai High Priest attempts to run away in fear!\",\"timestamp\":1784560245,\"id\":\"s51_2591\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Wmccain-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Wmccain-Zul'jin receives loot: |cnIQ1:|T3528456:12|t|Hitem:173202::::::::80:66:::::::::|h[Shrouded Cloth]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1784560260,\"id\":\"s51_2592\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Tiemyshoee-Jubei'Thos receives loot: |cnIQ1:|T3528456:12|t|Hitem:173202::::::::80:66:::::::::|h[Shrouded Cloth]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1784560287,\"id\":\"s51_2593\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hakkar the Soulflayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Hakkar the Soulflayer yells: The power... was mine...\",\"timestamp\":1784560330,\"id\":\"s51_2594\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T463446:12|t|Hcurrency:1166:0|h[Timewarped Badge]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1784560332,\"id\":\"s51_2595\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Praisesun\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ3:|T3395742:12|t|Hitem:179326::::::::80:66::22:4:6652:8811:13609:7756:2:9:80:28:5383:::::|h[Girdle of the Soulflayer (Waist 126)]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1784560333,\"id\":\"s51_2596\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 14 Gold, 37 Silver, 98 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1784560334,\"id\":\"s51_2597\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: Ol' Hakkar, him a nasty one. But ya be makin' him pay him debt. Sooner or later, him gonna be back. Ya can't keep a bad loa down!\",\"timestamp\":1784560336,\"id\":\"s51_2598\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mueh'zala\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Mueh'zala yells: Me want dem souls, Bwonsamdi! Me want Rastakhan and all da other Zandalari! It ain't wise ta be holdin' out on Mueh'zala!\",\"timestamp\":1784560359,\"id\":\"s51_2599\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi yells: Ya gone and forgot what it mean ta be a loa! Ya bond wit da people... da power ya share... NNNNGGGG!\",\"timestamp\":1784560373,\"id\":\"s51_2600\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mueh'zala\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Mueh'zala yells: Da only power dat counts be Death! And Death be comin' for dem all!\",\"timestamp\":1784560384,\"id\":\"s51_2601\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: Ya know, it don't just be trolls who be comin' ta ask for ol' Bwonsamdi's help. All kinds be makin' deals wit da loa of death!\",\"timestamp\":1784560392,\"id\":\"s51_2602\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: Like dese two crazy little gnomes here. Dey both be hungry for power, so me were more than happy to oblige.\",\"timestamp\":1784560402,\"id\":\"s51_2603\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bwonsamdi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Bwonsamdi says: But now, uh... me be needin' dat mojo back!\",\"timestamp\":1784560413,\"id\":\"s51_2604\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Wmccain-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Wmccain-Zul'jin receives loot: |cnIQ0:|T458717:12|t|Hitem:176869::::::::80:66:::::::::|h[Bone Chip]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1784560457,\"id\":\"s51_2605\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"name\":\"Scarlotta-Saurfang\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Scarlotta-Saurfang receives loot: |cnIQ0:|T458717:12|t|Hitem:176869::::::::80:66:::::::::|h[Bone Chip]|h|rx3.\",\"timestamp\":1784560457,\"id\":\"s51_2606\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Wmccain-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Wmccain-Zul'jin receives loot: |cnIQ1:|T3528456:12|t|Hitem:17320