",\"timestamp\":1784593256},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Devos\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Devos says: As I peered into Uther's memories, what I saw shook me to the core.\",\"id\":\"s51_2863\",\"timestamp\":1784593263},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Devos\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Devos says: But you refused to see the truth. That the path is flawed. That we serve a lie.\",\"id\":\"s51_2864\",\"timestamp\":1784593271},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Devos\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Devos says: And so, I listened to the Jailer's words. I learned of the great injustice you and the others thrust upon him... and upon us all.\",\"id\":\"s51_2865\",\"timestamp\":1784593279},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Devos\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Devos says: He seeks to free us from the prison we have built for ourselves. And for that, he has earned my loyalty.\",\"id\":\"s51_2866\",\"timestamp\":1784593291},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kyrestia the Firstborne\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kyrestia the Firstborne says: And I mourn your betrayal.\",\"id\":\"s51_2867\",\"timestamp\":1784593300},{\"recordedBy\":\"Praisesun-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kyrestia the Firstborne\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_S