75529,\"id\":\"s51_3229\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"N'Zoth the Corruptor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"b\":0.9215686917304993},\"text\":\"N'Zoth the Corruptor whispers: My empire is this world's inevitable destiny.\",\"timestamp\":1785175540,\"id\":\"s51_3230\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Occult Shadowmender\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Occult Shadowmender says: Our slumber is over!\",\"timestamp\":1785175545,\"id\":\"s51_3231\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Monstrous Behemoth\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Monstrous Behemoth:288:MONSTER_SAY:|h[Monstrous Behemoth]|h says: [Shath'Yar] Yrr Bo'al Uhnish iiqaath!\",\"timestamp\":1785175545,\"id\":\"s51_3232\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maddened Conscript\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Maddened Conscript says: Kneel before your new masters!\",\"timestamp\":1785175545,\"id\":\"s51_3233\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"MOTHER\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"MOTHER says: Signal interference negated. Connection restored.\",\"timestamp\":1785175549,\"id\":\"s51_3234\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magni Bronzebeard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magni Bronzebeard says: Yer back! What happened?\",\"timestamp\":1785175556,\"id\":\"s51_3235\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wrathion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Wrathion says: I learned that it doesn't take much for my friends to believe I betrayed them.\",\"timestamp\":1785175559,\"id\":\"s51_3236\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wrathion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Wrathion says: Champions, that vision was as much for me as it was for you. N'Zoth wants us to believe that my corruption is inevitable.\",\"timestamp\":1785175564,\"id\":\"s51_3237\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wrathion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Wrathion says: Doubt me if you must, but know that I will not rest until his smoldering corpse lies at my feet.\",\"timestamp\":1785175572,\"id\":\"s51_3238\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"N'Zoth the Corruptor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"b\":0.9215686917304993},\"text\":\"N'Zoth the Corruptor whispers: Watch as my empire consumes your reality. Soon, all will be one.\",\"timestamp\":1785175573,\"id\":\"s51_3239\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Stormclout-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Stormclout|r]|h has earned the 