":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|T4904647:12|t|Hitem:202559::::::::90:258::6:5:7981:9380:6652:1498:8767:1:28:2647:::::|h[Infernal Shadelance (Two-Hand 83)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s51_4635\",\"timestamp\":1785281751},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 124 Gold, 30 Silver, 21 Copper\",\"id\":\"s51_4636\",\"timestamp\":1785281752},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wrathion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Wrathion says: Finally, its grip weakens.\",\"id\":\"s51_4637\",\"timestamp\":1785281758},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sabellian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sabellian says: Does Sarkareth wield some power that can tear at our minds?\",\"id\":\"s51_4638\",\"timestamp\":1785281761},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: The betrayer holds no such power, my son. Sinister forces are awakening... they sense your presence.\",\"id\":\"s51_4639\",\"timestamp\":1785281765},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sabellian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sabellian says: Father?\",\"id\":\"s51_4640\",\"timestamp\":1785281774},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: I am but an echo. I cannot stop intruders from attempting to plunder my secrets.\",\"id\":\"s51_4641\",\"timestamp\":1785281776},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: Now that my heirs have arrived, we can ensure no outsider claims what is rightfully yours.\",\"id\":\"s51_4642\",\"timestamp\":1785281783},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: I assume you have heard many stories of this place, and the role it played in my downfall.\",\"id\":\"s51_4643\",\"timestamp\":1785281791},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: Do not let them temper your perception.\",\"id\":\"s51_4644\",\"timestamp\":1785281799},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: These halls are your birthright, and the outsiders must not be allowed to take them from you.\",\"id\":\"s51_4645\",\"timestamp\":1785281802},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sabellian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sabellian says: Secure our perimeter!\",\"id\":\"s51_4646\",\"timestamp\":1785281809},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sabellian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sabellian says: Wrathion, I will take a contingent down these halls and root out Sarkareth. You take the other path and see what you can find.\",\"id\":\"s51_4647\",\"timestamp\":1785281811},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: A wise plan. I shall accompany both of you and lend what aid I can.\",\"id\":\"s51_4648\",\"timestamp\":1785281818},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: Sabellian, as my blood I look to you to inherit. But know there are many who would steal your birthright.\",\"id\":\"s51_4649\",\"timestamp\":1785281824},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Neltharion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Neltharion says: Even now, djaradin forces use the chaos to launch an assault. They must be stopped.\",\"id\":\"s51_4650\",\"timestamp\":1785281836},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Stewpindus\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stewpindus-Tichondrius:88:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aStewpindus|r]|h: tyvm\",\"timestamp\":1785281847,\"id\":\"s51_4651\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sabellian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Sabellian says: I will not yield any ground.\",\"timestamp\":1785281847,\"id\":\"s51_4652\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Ouamzle\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Ouamzle-Tichondrius:90:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Ouamzle|r]|h: r\",\"timestamp\":1785281848,\"id\":\"s51_4653\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Stewpindus\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stewpindus-Tichondrius:91:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aStewpindus|r]|h: anyone haved a toon they wanna lvl?\",\"timestamp\":1785281868,\"id\":\"s51_4654\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Stewpindus\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stewpindus-Tichondrius:92:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aStewpindus|r]|h: tanking timewalks\",\"timestamp\":1785281880,\"id\":\"s51_4655\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Justiz-Daggerspine\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Justiz-Daggerspine|h[|cfff48cbaJustiz-Daggerspine|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61269:Player-1136-08C94A88:1:7:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Keystone Hero: Maisara Caverns]|h|r