\"id\":\"s52_3158\",\"timestamp\":1786385709},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Pards\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Pards-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebPards|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62545:Player-11-0EB1BD4E:1:8:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Challenge: Malevolent Boons]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s52_3159\",\"timestamp\":1786385709},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Pards\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Pards-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebPards|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62453:Player-11-0EB1BD4E:1:8:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Ritual Sites 415: Applied Ritual Strategies]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s52_3160\",\"timestamp\":1786385709},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Den Welcomer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Den Welcomer says: Good, you are here. The elders and others await you below.\",\"id\":\"s52_3161\",\"timestamp\":1786385928},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ban-Lu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ban-Lu says: Good to see you again, Grandmaster.\",\"id\":\"s52_3162\",\"timestamp\":1786385935},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: So many old wounds. It makes them tense, being near those who were enemies for so long.\",\"id\":\"s52_3163\",\"timestamp\":1786385949},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: For a group that has avoided trolls and elves for so long, the haranir seem rather rushed to tell us something.\",\"id\":\"s52_3164\",\"timestamp\":1786385953},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra says: Many kaldorei still view us with scorn. To them, we are either cowards who hid from the Legion or traitors who joined the Horde.\",\"id\":\"s52_3165\",\"timestamp\":1786385957},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Queen Talanji\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Queen Talanji says: All of Azeroth respects de haranir for fighting against de Void. But to bring so many old enemies to one place? Watch carefully.\",\"id\":\"s52_3166\",\"timestamp\":1786385961},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rokhan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rokhan says: De Darkspear spilled blood with some of de trolls and elves here. But I be willing to set aside old rivalries for de common good.\",\"id\":\"s52_3167\",\"timestamp\":1786385969},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: I am told the Amani have been invited as well. Do not expect me to break bread with those murderers.\",\"id\":\"s52_3168\",\"timestamp\":1786385972},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: The kaldorei will do what we must for the preservation of this world... and the protection of our people.\",\"id\":\"s52_3169\",\"timestamp\":1786385975},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Stormclout? How nice to see another familiar face here!\",\"id\":\"s52_3170\",\"timestamp\":1786385981},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T7386623:12|t|Hitem:246731::::::::90:269::11::1:28:872:::::|h[Dusk Grimlynx]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s52_3171\",\"timestamp\":1786385984},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: It's good to have you along, Stormclout. Now where is my nephew?\",\"id\":\"s52_3172\",\"timestamp\":1786385988},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Proof? What do you mean proof?\",\"id\":\"s52_3173\",\"timestamp\":1786386005},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: The defenders of the Vale are growing weary. Use this rejuvenation pollen to revive them.\",\"id\":\"s52_3174\",\"timestamp\":1786386005},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Orweyna. How do you know Hagar speaks the truth?\",\"id\":\"s52_3175\",\"timestamp\":1786386008},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ban-Lu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ban-Lu says: Do not concern yourself with failure, Grandmaster. Rather, focus on rising every time you fall.\",\"id\":\"s52_3176\",\"timestamp\":1786386025},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: The proof lies in one of the paintings within.\",\"id\":\"s52_3177\",\"timestamp\":1786386070},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ban-Lu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ban-Lu says: Farewell!\",\"id\":\"s52_3178\",\"timestamp\":1786386113},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shadow Hunter Ukambe\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Shadow Hunter Ukambe says: Boss, I got the recent threats sketched out on the table for ya whenever you be ready.\",\"id\":\"s52_3179\",\"timestamp\":1786386196},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gruul\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gruul yells: Gruul smell flesh...\",\"id\":\"s52_3180\",\"timestamp\":1786386480},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gruul\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gruul yells: Gruul... Fall... Down?\",\"id\":\"s52_3181\",\"timestamp\":1786386480},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Stormclout-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Stormclout|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:8966:Player-11-0EB8C39F:1:8:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Mythic: Gruul]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s52_3182\",\"timestamp\":1786386480},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Stormclout-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Stormclout|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:8966:Player-11-0EB8C39F:1:8:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Mythic: Gruul]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s52_3183\",\"timestamp\":1786386480},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"na