",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|T7651212:12|t|Hitem:279231::::::::90:269::60:1:13844:1:28:5381:::::|h[Ancient Amani Spear (Two-Hand 256)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s52_4692\",\"timestamp\":1786507461},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Her again. Nek'zali. We must witness the rest of this vision together.\",\"id\":\"s52_4693\",\"timestamp\":1786507466},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo yells: Dis is no time for sermons, Nek'zali! De aqir are upon us!\",\"id\":\"s52_4694\",\"timestamp\":1786507475},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: My brother is right. It is time to take action.\",\"id\":\"s52_4695\",\"timestamp\":1786507480},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Yan'ti the Bold\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Yan'ti the Bold says: That's a lot of bugs.\",\"id\":\"s52_4696\",\"timestamp\":1786507489},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo says: Look around, Nek'zali. There is no more time. De loa do not answer us.\",\"id\":\"s52_4697\",\"timestamp\":1786507495},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo says: You are more than a cultist, sister. Be de hero I know you can be.\",\"id\":\"s52_4698\",\"timestamp\":1786507500},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|T7506530:12|t|Hitem:260587::::::::90:269:::::::::|h[Ritual Dagger]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s52_4699\",\"timestamp\":1786507502},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Summoner Jawae\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.9215686917304993,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Summoner Jawae whispers: Our warriors die for de Amani. But with their souls, you will save us.\",\"id\":\"s52_4700\",\"timestamp\":1786507502},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Cobern-Bonechewer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cobern-Bonechewer|h[|cfff48cbaCobern-Bonechewer|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:9828:Player-1136-084CC661:1:8:11:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Ten Hit Tunes]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s52_4701\",\"timestamp\":1786507536},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Jaz'di Wiseman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Jaz'di Wiseman says: N-Nek'zali? What are you doing?\",\"id\":\"s52_4702\",\"timestamp\":1786507557},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: What must be done, you old fool.\",\"id\":\"s52_4703\",\"timestamp\":1786507561},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Hunter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Injured Hunter says: Get up! We need ya to fight!\",\"id\":\"s52_4704\",\"timestamp\":1786507565},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: It's true. I need you. Both of you.\",\"id\":\"s52_4705\",\"timestamp\":1786507568},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Hunter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Injured Hunter says: Nek'zali! Over here! We need ya healing!\",\"id\":\"s52_4706\",\"timestamp\":1786507576},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: Of course. Let me relieve ya sufferin'.\",\"id\":\"s52_4707\",\"timestamp\":1786507580},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Hunter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Injured Hunter says: Priestess! There are too many of them!\",\"id\":\"s52_4708\",\"timestamp\":1786507615},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: If you won't fight, I have another use for ya.\",\"id\":\"s52_4709\",\"timestamp\":1786507618},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Jaz'di Wiseman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Jaz'di Wiseman says: I failed you, my pupil...\",\"id\":\"s52_4710\",\"timestamp\":1786507651},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: You failed de Amani. But I won't.\",\"id\":\"s52_4711\",\"timestamp\":1786507656},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zuyna the Rival\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zuyna the Rival says: Dis what you been plannin', witch? I'll cut ya neck!\",\"id\":\"s52_4712\",\"timestamp\":1786507669},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zuyna the Rival\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zuyna the Rival says: Always... hated ya...\",\"id\":\"s52_4713\",\"timestamp\":1786507684},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: De feelin' was mutual.\",\"id\":\"s52_4714\",\"timestamp\":1786507688},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kith'ix\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kith'ix:2928:MONSTER_YELL:|h[Kith'ix]|h yells: [Shath'Yar] OG HNAKF! PHGWA'CUL WGAH ZZ AG SHFK!\",\"id\":\"s52_4715\",\"timestamp\":1786507700},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo says: De aqir come! Evacuate to de shore!\",\"id\":\"s52_4716\",\"timestamp\":1786507700},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: I have seen de rift beneath de world! From it, I summon power for de Amani!\",\"id\":\"s52_4717\",\"timestamp\":1786507703},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nek'zali the Soulcoiler says: No. Gather to me, my Soulcoilers!\",\"id\":\"s52_4718\",\"timestamp\":1786507703},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Strongblood Jak'mo says: Sister! What are ya-- Stop!\",\"id\":\"s52_4719\",\"timestamp\":1786507713},{\"recordedBy