ER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Akil'zon's winds guide you. We'll get ready to fight when everyone stops fussing over dis little cut.\",\"timestamp\":1786722620,\"id\":\"s54_2765\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De Children of Ula'tek must not reinforce their line. Spear dem out of de skies!\",\"timestamp\":1786722661,\"id\":\"s54_2766\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Hold. I hear... the goddess's voice! She is reaching out to us...\",\"timestamp\":1786722664,\"id\":\"s54_2767\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: We beseech you, goddess. Show us what you mean for us to see.\",\"timestamp\":1786722667,\"id\":\"s54_2768\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of a Priestess\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of a Priestess says: Pick up ya spear, Jak'mo. Our people are dyin'. De Amani need ya.\",\"timestamp\":1786722672,\"id\":\"s54_2769\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1786722676,\"id\":\"s54_2770\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Let her wisdom guide your way. I will find you ahead.\",\"timestamp\":1786722677,\"id\":\"s54_2771\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: A vision of the past! We are listening, goddess!\",\"timestamp\":1786722679,\"id\":\"s54_2772\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of Panic\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of Panic says: Our warband is not strong enough! We must retreat!\",\"timestamp\":1786722682,\"id\":\"s54_2773\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of a Priestess\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of a Priestess says: Run back to de Zandalari and their loa? No. Put your faith in me.\",\"timestamp\":1786722695,\"id\":\"s54_2774\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of a Warlord\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of a Warlord says: What have you done, Nek'zali?\",\"timestamp\":1786722702,\"id\":\"s54_2775\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of a Priestess\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of a Priestess says: I defended our people. I took this land for de Amani!\",\"timestamp\":1786722720,\"id\":\"s54_2776\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Memory of a Priestess\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Memory of a Priestess says: Ya think ya can bury me? I curse de Amani! I don't forget, I don't surrender, and I never die!\",\"timestamp\":1786722727,\"id\":\"s54_2777\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: She must have led us here for a reason.\",\"timestamp\":1786722738,\"id\":\"s54_2778\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: With nature's strength. Together!\",\"timestamp\":1786722741,\"id\":\"s54_2779\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Auteist\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|T7874485:12|t|Hitem:278908::::::::90:62::60:1:13844:1:28:5381:::::|h[Tomb-Sealed Sash (Waist 256)]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1786722754,\"id\":\"s54_2780\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1786722755,\"id\":\"s54_2781\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: The goddess guides our steps. We must follow the path and learn what we can from the dead.\",\"timestamp\":1786722758,\"id\":\"s54_2782\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx1\",\"timestamp\":1786722771,\"id\":\"s54_2783\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Auteist\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1786722775,\"id\":\"s54_2784\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Auteist\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|T134414:12|t|Hitem:6948::::::::90:62:::::::::|h[Hearthstone]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1786722802,\"id\":\"s54_2785\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Auteist\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Your |cnIQ3:|T7350067:12|t|Hitem:258957::::::::90:62::25:2:12817:6652:1:28:5381:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Staff (Two-Hand 266)]|h|r was changed to |cnIQ3:|T7350067:12|t|Hitem:258957::::::::90:62::25:2:6652:12818:1:28:5381:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Staff (Two-Hand 269)]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1786722877,\"id\":\"s54_2786\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Auteist\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.66666668