l to our mission that you secure it.\",\"id\":\"s54_2796\",\"timestamp\":1786726195},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: Your attire seems adequate. How may I assist you?\",\"timestamp\":1786726646,\"id\":\"s54_2797\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Chartast\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"b\":0.9215686917304993},\"text\":\"Chartast whispers: Loosen my bonds, and I will show you the might of this world.\",\"timestamp\":1786726702,\"id\":\"s54_2798\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: This Singularity Anchor should be able to temporarily seal the Void anomalies. We must protect it while it charges.\",\"timestamp\":1786726875,\"id\":\"s54_2799\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xy'dax\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Xy'dax says: I have items that may aid you in your task... for the right price.\",\"timestamp\":1786726880,\"id\":\"s54_2800\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: Quickly, champion. Prepare the defenses around the Singularity Anchor before the enemy arrives!\",\"timestamp\":1786726886,\"id\":\"s54_2801\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"play