Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: We must be careful. Untold horrors could be waking in the temple.\",\"timestamp\":1787073315,\"id\":\"s54_4648\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Namalis-Malorne\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Namalis-Malorne creates: |cnIQ1:|T538744:12|t|Hitem:224464::::::::90:269::4:::::::|h[Demonic Healthstone]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1787073317,\"id\":\"s54_4649\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: For thousands of years, dis temple been sealed away. We did not know why.\",\"timestamp\":1787073320,\"id\":\"s54_4650\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Now we know it was to hide de Soulcoiler's unspeakable rituals--and de body of Ula'tek.\",\"timestamp\":1787073326,\"id\":\"s54_4651\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: And my brother has dug it all up again! Dey were all buried for a reason, Zul'jan! What have you got yourself into?\",\"timestamp\":1787073334,\"id\":\"s54_4652\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":2}