:23:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Keystone Master: Season 2]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s57_3954\",\"timestamp\":1787526932},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Myls-Drakkari\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"¡|Hplayer:Myls-Drakkari|h[|cfffff468Myls-Drakkari|r]|h ha ganado el logro |cffffff00|Hachievement:62447:Player-1425-0EE56FBA:1:8:23:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Keystone Master: Season 2]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s57_3955\",\"timestamp\":1787526933},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: Lightbloom spores are spilling out of The Blinding Bloom. Get rid of them before they spread.\",\"id\":\"s57_3956\",\"timestamp\":1787527189},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s57_3957\",\"timestamp\":1787527200},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: Hellavator, I am in need of more venom and also more healing water.\",\"id\":\"s57_3958\",\"timestamp\":1787527201},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: Since you are in the Ahl'ua Wetland, would you do me this favor?\",\"id\":\"s57_3959\",\"timestamp\":1787527206},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: Some meddlesome miscreants have spread acorns around the Cradle. Clean them up, won't you?\",\"id\":\"s57_3960\",\"timestamp\":1787527211},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ7:|T6255014:12|t|Hitem:264882::::::::90:267:::::::::|h[Finery Funds]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3961\",\"timestamp\":1787527242},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Go. Place your hand upon the stone and offer your soul to memory. What greets you may not be kind... but it will be true.\",\"id\":\"s57_3962\",\"timestamp\":1787527308},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: When the Haranir first walked this land, they met no welcome--only fangs and fury, as creatures struck with deliberate, unseen intent.\",\"id\":\"s57_3963\",\"timestamp\":1787527368},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Battle was joined, tooth and claw against vine and thorn... but in that frenzy, they teetered on the abyss of madness.\",\"id\":\"s57_3964\",\"timestamp\":1787527378},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Wey'nan saw the point from which his people were struck. Thus, the hunted became the hunter, drawn to the silent cave where truth lay hidden.\",\"id\":\"s57_3965\",\"timestamp\":1787527426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zaratti Scryer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zaratti Scryer sniffs the air...\",\"id\":\"s57_3966\",\"timestamp\":1787527507},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The beast lay broken alongside Wey'nan's fallen kin. Had they fallen to its claws or his own? Rage numbed him until the scent of home pulled him back from the abyss.\",\"id\":\"s57_3967\",\"timestamp\":1787527518},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|T134531:12|t|Hitem:241349::::::::90:267:::::::::|h[Fragrant Mushroom Cap]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3968\",\"timestamp\":1787527523},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You create: |cnIQ1:|T538744:12|t|Hitem:224464::::::::90:267:::::::::|h[Demonic Healthstone]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s57_3969\",\"timestamp\":1787527558},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: A lesson unmarked is a lesson soon forgotten. So Wey'nan took the remains of his foe in order to make a charm of remembrance.\",\"id\":\"s57_3970\",\"timestamp\":1787527632},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unknown\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Unknown says: No... The rage took hold... consumed me. I won't... can't... let it happen again.\",\"id\":\"s57_3971\",\"timestamp\":1787527632},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|T134210:12|t|Hitem:241611::::::::90:267:::::::::|h[Zarat's Head]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3972\",\"timestamp\":1787527634},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Clutching his foe's remains, Wey'nan led his allies to a magical dust-filled cavern. There, the remnants were bound into a charm--balance held in both hand and heart.\",\"id\":\"s57_3973\",\"timestamp\":1787527644},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Cherishp\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cherishp-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Cherishp|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62507:Player-11-0E9C6B04:1:8:23:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Void Smasher: Eversong]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s57_3974\",\"timestamp\":1787527647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wey'nan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Wey'nan says: Help me fill these containers with just the right portions of this magical dust.\",\"id\":\"s57_3975\",\"timestamp\":1787527657},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wey'nan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Wey'nan says: Add a little at a time to each vial till you reach the mark I put on the containers. Once you have the containers filled, let me know and I'll finish crafting the ward.\",\"id\":\"s57_3976\",\"timestamp\":1787527662},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wey'nan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Wey'nan says: Move quickly--the dust begins to dissolve as soon as it is poured!\",\"id\":\"s57_3977\",\"timestamp\":1787527671},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: And so the charm was made: a warning, a reminder. We must be more than instinct.\",\"id\":\"s57_3978\",\"timestamp\":1787527696},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|T7491966:12|t|Hitem:263037::::::::90:267::11::1:28:3321:::::|h[Replica Wey'nan's Ward]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3979\",\"timestamp\":1787527723},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T348526:12|t|Hitem:279525::::::::90:267::11::2:9:90:28:3321:::::|h[Avid Learner's Supply Pack]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3980\",\"timestamp\":1787527723},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T7551419:12|t|Hitem:274476::::::::90:267:::::::::|h[Spark of Tides]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3981\",\"timestamp\":1787527723},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Now I understand. You've returned to us not just the tale of a relic... but reminded us of Wey'nan's lesson. Thank you!\",\"id\":\"s57_3982\",\"timestamp\":1787527724},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T133016:12|t|Hcurrency:3310:0|h[Coffer Key Shards]|h|rx19\",\"id\":\"s57_3983\",\"timestamp\":1787527725},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T7412480:12|t|Hitem:259349::::::::90:267::30:2:12826:6652:1:28:3321:::::|h[Blossoming Rootwarden's Focus (Ranged 282)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3984\",\"timestamp\":1787527725},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|T7137586:12|t|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx100\",\"id\":\"s57_3985\",\"timestamp\":1787527726},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|T7734062:12|t|Hcurrency:3438:0|h[Veteran Mistcrest]|h|rx20\",\"id\":\"s57_3986\",\"timestamp\":1787527726},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T7252741:12|t|Hitem:263265::::::::90:267::29:3:13662:12825:13696:1:28:4240:::::|h[Hara'ti Defender's Sash (Waist 279)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3987\",\"timestamp\":1787527768},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|T7517186:12|t|Hitem:258948::::::::90:267::25:2:12817:41:1:28:3321:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Knife (One-Hand 266)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3988\",\"timestamp\":1787528001},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|T7319164:12|t|Hitem:258960::::::::90:267::25:2:12817:42:1:28:5381:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Beacon (Held In Off-hand 266)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3989\",\"timestamp\":1787528026},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Guard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The nearby guard glares at you and the void energy that you surround yourself with.\",\"id\":\"s57_3990\",\"timestamp\":1787528040},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|T1391719:12|t|Hitem:258909::::::::90:267::25:3:12817:6652:13668:1:28:5381:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Signet (Finger 266)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3991\",\"timestamp\":1787528085},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|T1391719:12|t|Hitem:258909::::::::90:267::25:3:12817:6652:13668:1:28:5381:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Signet (Finger 266)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s57_3992\",\"timestamp\":1787528085},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Hellavator\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hp